Subject: [PATCH 189/488] soh: rename func_800FCB70 -> PadUtils_Destroy

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: empty no-op sitting immediately after PadUtils_Init in padutils.c; the Init/Destroy pairing is the codebase's usual shape, but nothing calls it so the intent is inferred from position alone.
Defined in soh/src/code/padutils.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
